WEBVTT

00:13:57.249 --> 00:14:01.837
So, what keeps me
really excited about this work,

00:14:01.837 --> 00:14:04.715
working to help cities cool down

00:14:04.756 --> 00:14:06.842
and work against climate change,

00:14:06.884 --> 00:14:10.596
is also that I feel
that I'm really helping

00:14:10.637 --> 00:14:14.099
create much more
wonderful cities to live in.

00:14:14.892 --> 00:14:17.394
So just think about this,

00:14:17.436 --> 00:14:20.647
cranking up the air conditioning

00:14:20.689 --> 00:14:22.774
is just not going to cut it.

00:14:23.525 --> 00:14:24.693
Thank you.

00:14:24.735 --> 00:14:30.866
(Applause)